stoken
------------------------------------------
RSA SecurID-compatible software token for Linux/UNIX systems

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libcairo2-1.18.6-1
  libglib2.0_0-2.90.1-1
  libgtk3_0-3.24.52-1
  libstoken-devel-0.93-1bl2
  libstoken1-0.93-1bl2
  libtomcrypt-devel-1.18.2-1bl3
  libtomcrypt1-1.18.2-1bl3
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  libxml2_2-2.13.9-3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libcairo-devel-1.18.6-1
  libglib2.0-devel-2.90.1-1
  libgtk3-devel-3.24.52-1
  libtomcrypt-devel-1.18.2-1bl3
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libxml2-devel-2.13.9-3
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/stoken-dev/stoken

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/stoken-dev/stoken/archive/refs/tags/v0.93.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack stoken-0.93-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./stoken-0.93-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/stoken-0.93-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/stoken-0.93-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libstoken1-0.93-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libstoken-devel-0.93-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

